        <mxCell id="c101" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#555A65&quot;&gt;C4 · Level 3 — Components of the Rust core&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#17181C;fontSize=11;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="62" width="1100" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c102" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#555A65&quot;&gt;Everything that decides is a pure function over values; time arrives as a parameter. The agent feeds it measurements and carries out its decisions; dyno-platform implements its ports (ADR 0001). Rules consult protect and see applications through grouping.&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#17181C;fontSize=11;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="82" width="1500" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
